<p>Dear <%= @user.name %>,</p>

<p><strong><%= @portfolio_company.investor_name %></strong> submitted their KPI report for the period ending <strong><%= l @kpi_report.as_of %></strong>, but the workbook could not be imported.</p>

<% if @errors.any? %>
  <p>Problems found:</p>
  <ul>
    <% @errors.first(10).each do |message| %>
      <li><%= message %></li>
    <% end %>
  </ul>
<% end %>

<p>The report has been reopened so the portfolio company can correct the file and submit again. They have been emailed the details.</p>

<p><%= link_to 'Open KPI Report', kpi_report_url(@kpi_report, host: @entity.sub_domain + '.' + ENV.fetch('DOMAIN', 'localhost')), class: "btn btn-outline-primary" %></p>

<p>Thank you,<br><%= @entity.name %> System</p>
